{"id":"ganado","lemma":"ganado","pos":"noun","rank":908,"glosses":["livestock, cattle","herd (group of animals)","swarm (group of bees)"],"ipa":"/ɡaˈnado/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ganados"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ganado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quién ha ganado hoy?","en":"Who won today?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/410437"},{"text":"Hemos ganado el concurso.","en":"We won the contest.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501505"},{"text":"He ganado la partida.","en":"I have won the game.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514946"},{"text":"Nada arriesgado, nada ganado.","en":"Nothing ventured, nothing gained.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803601"},{"text":"Has ganado peso, ¿verdad?","en":"You've put on weight, haven't you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352749"}]}